  "description": "“If I were given another chance...” \n\n10 years after the apocalypse began on Earth, while he faced imminent death, Yoohyun was filled with regret. Just then, a bright light descended upon him. When he opened his eyes, he was greeted by an unfamiliar scene. Not only had he reincarnated as a non-human race called “Teller,” but he had also traveled back in time by 10 years! \n\n“Now that it has come to this, I’ll live my best life this time! ” \n\nUnlike his previous life, where he was solely focused on survival, he is now determined to lead a successful life. In this new life he has gained, will Yoohyun truly be able to become the protagonist? \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
